        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "The radiators went cold last evening. It's about 55 degrees inside now.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Okay, thanks. Since when exactly, do you know?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "It was last evening, around the time I was getting ready for bed. So it's been out since then, all through the night.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thank you. Is there anything else the technician should know, like banging pipes or the system shutting off on its own?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "No banging that I've noticed. The radiators just went cold, nothing else. Oh, and I should mention I'm the only one here, if that matters for when they come.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for telling me. What's the best phone number to reach you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "The number I'm calling from, 332-555-0118.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Okay, one moment. So that's forty-five Forest Avenue, and the number you're calling from, ending in zero one one eight. That's all correct, right?",
