        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, that's all correct.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Just a moment. The soonest I have is today, 1:30 to 2. If anything makes this more urgent for you, just let me know. Does that work?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, 1:30 today works. Thank you so much.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "One sec. Got it. Will you be able to approve any repair work the technician recommends?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I'm not sure how that works. Could you tell me what you mean? I'd want to know what they're going to do before they start anything.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "The technician will go over any costs with you before doing the work. Will you be able to approve any repair work they recommend?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, I can approve it, as long as they explain what it is and what it costs first. Is there anything else I need to do before they come?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Nothing else is needed from you before they come. Would you like to tell me how the technician can get in, like a gate code or a key?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Oh, I'll be home, so I can let them in. The door is just at the front of the house, and I'll come down with my cane to open it. If they ring the bell, I'll hear it.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Okay, one moment. I've marked this call top priority, so you get our soonest opening. Okay, I've booked it: the technician will arrive today between 1:30 and 2. Anything else?",
