          "text": "It's completely out. It doesn't blow any heat at all, and the thermostat is reading 62 degrees.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Okay, thanks. And since when has it been completely out?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Since last night. It was working fine during the day yesterday, and then it just stopped.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it. Anything else the technician should know, like banging pipes or it shutting off on its own?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I didn't hear any banging or noises. I haven't noticed it turning on and off on its own, it just stopped heating. I did change the batteries in the thermostat, but that didn't make a difference.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
